      "primary_message": "In a blender, combine cold brew concentrate, sweetened coconut cream, unsweetened coconut cream, ice, and salt. Pulse a few times to break the ice, then blend on high speed until a slushy consistency forms, 30 to 60 seconds. Pour into a glass and serve.",
