  "description": "This blended iced coconut coffee is refreshing, creamy, and just sweet enough. It's made with cold brew concentrate and coconut cream for bold flavor and rich texture.",
  "notes": "Notes: This recipe can easily be doubled.\nI prefer the robust flavor of undiluted cold-brew concentrate in this drink, but if you like a milder drink, you can use regular cold-brew coffee. For an unsweetened version, omit the sweetened coconut cream and double the amount of unsweetened coconut cream.\n\nMake-ahead and storage: Iced drinks are best enjoyed immediately after blending.",
